  "body": "North-facing to capture the sunshine throughout the day, 5 Eaves Bush Parade offers a relaxed, low-maintenance lifestyle in one of Orewa's most sought-after developments Kensington Park.  Open to all ages and stages, this is an ideal holiday home or year around base for anyone seeking to enjoy all of the benefits of executive living complemented by amenities and natural wonders at your doorstep.  Acres of landscaped gardens, the walking tracks of Alice Eaves Scenic Reserve, the golden sands of Orewa beach, and the community's shared indoor pool, gym, sauna will become a part of your everyday lifestyle.  \r\n\r\nThe home itself is modern and easy-care, with two bedrooms and two bathrooms, complemented by double glazing, under tile heating and a heat pump for year-round comfort.  This is a home designed for those who value convenience without compromising on lifestyle.  One of the standout features is your own garage with generous space for two cars and extra room for the bikes, kayaks, paddleboards and other beach toys that come with living by the coast. Internal stairs give you private access to your own front door and your upper storey apartment, elevated to maximise privacy and views.\r\n\r\nOrewa Village, with its cafés, shops and everyday conveniences, is a flat and easy walk away, while nearby motorway access makes commuting to the North Shore or Auckland City straightforward.  Whether you're downsizing from a larger property, looking for a coastal base or simply ready to spend less time on home maintenance and more time enjoying life, this is an appealing opportunity to secure your own slice of Kensington Park.\r\n\r\nLock up, head out and enjoy everything Orewa has to offer.",
